                <invention-title lang="de">DEKODIERUNGSVORRICHTUNG, KODIERVORRICHTUNG UND ÜBERTRAGUNGSVORRICHTUNG</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">APPAREIL DE DÉCODAGE, APPAREIL DE CODAGE ET APPAREIL DE TRANSMISSION</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">DECODING APPARATUS, ENCODING APPARATUS AND TRANSMITTING APPARATUS</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A decoding apparatus for a video decoding is configured to receive (S1810) video information including information related to a prediction mode, information on a tile (610, 620) and information on a slice, wherein the tile (610, 620) is a common rectangular region of a column of largest coding units (LCUs) and a row of largest coding units (LCUs) and the slice comprises an integer number of largest coding units (LCUs); derive (S1820) the tile (610, 620) and the slice in a current picture (300; 400; 500; 1110; 1210; 1410) based on the received video information, wherein the current picture (300; 400; 500; 1110; 1210; 1410) includes more than one tile (610, 620) and more than one slice; and perform decoding (S1830) for the current picture (300; 400; 500; 1110; 1210; 1410) based on the more than one tile (610, 620) and the more than one slice. The decoding (S1830) for the current picture (300; 400; 500; 1110; 1210; 1410) includes performing inter prediction or intra prediction to derive a predicted block of a current block in the current picture based on the information related to the prediction mode; and generating a reconstructed picture of the current picture based on the predicted block. The following constraints are imposed:- The largest coding units (LCUs) in the slice are ordered consecutively in tile scan order.- In the tile scan order, largest coding units (LCUs) in each of the tiles (610, 620) in the slice are ordered in the raster scan order in the each of the tiles (610, 620), and the tiles (610, 620) in the slice are ordered in the raster scan order.- TileIDs specifying the tiles (610, 620) ordered in the slice are consecutive.</p>
            </abstract>
